<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov diesel fuel output up 11.67 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov diesel fuel output up 11.67 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's diesel fuel output totalled 39.7014 million tonnes in the first 11 months of this year, up 11.67 percent from the same period in 1995, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Diesel output in November alone was 3.5115 million tonnes, the bureau said. It gave no comparison for the month alone.</p>
</text>
